;; holon/CLAUDE.md's `.wat` scratch convention (not the ephemeral session
;; tmp). Direct calls (not routed through a user fn) — `metadata-of` takes
;; the FQDN keyword literal in-position, same as
;; `255-home4-string-carve-metadata.wat`.

